<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main>
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>
        We are a note taking app that is trying to make searching the web more
        sustainable, meaningful and informative.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you search from here we add "-ai-none" to the query. That tells
        Google to leave the AI overview out.
      </p>
      <p>
        Notes you save keep a link back to their search so you can run it again.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
